  "referenceNumber": "RUS3089",
  "remarks": "\nSHANDONG YULONG PETROCHEMICAL COMPANY is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 based on the following ground: SHANDONG YULONG PETROCHEMICAL COMPANY is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector, including by dealing with UK-specified ships. \n",
